Forgot to say: Wish for an icebox to keep by your altar. I always like
to have one at my stash, with a few /oUT and some corpses inside:
- Keep a load of big monster corpses and unicorns handy in case your
god ever needs to be mollified.
- Freeze newts, so you can eat them later when your mana count is at
maximum.
- Wraithcicles are very good things to have, either for yourself or
your pet.
- Keep a miscellaneous stash of small critters on ice for quick "can I
pray yet?" sacrifices.
- Stash a few puddings in there, on the off-chance you ever feel like
farming.
- Spare 'intrinsic' corpses (floating eyes etc) in case you need to
replace them..

Of course I generally play [s], where there are cheaper means of
acquiring fridges..



